{"version":"0.1.0","license":"propriétaire","license_files":["MIT-hsk30.txt","UNICODE-LICENSE.txt","MIT-cjk-decomp.txt"],"source":"liste HSK 3.0 (GF 0025-2021) : caractères data/sources/listes/hsk-*.txt, mots data/sources/listes/hsk-mots.tsv (ivankra/hsk30, MIT) ; pinyin des caractères d'Unihan ; décomposition GF 0014-2009 réconciliée par le pipeline wenlu ; sens et exemples rédigés pour l'app et relus","source_url":"https://github.com/jon-gyt/zilin","modified":"2026-09-30 : assemblé par `wenlu export`","lot":41,"entrees":{"思":{"c":"思","pinyin":"sī","lectures":["sī","sāi"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["田","心"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0036","L2-0666","L2-0687","L3-0687","L4-0681","L5-0724","L7-0276","L7-0282","L7-0433","L7-1058","L7-1397","L7-1702","L7-2809","L7-3626","L7-3912","L7-3913","L7-3914","L7-3915","L7-4609"],"chemin":{"lire":117},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"penser, réfléchir, pensée","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Au petit sceau, 思 place 囟, le crâne vu d'en haut avec sa fontanelle, au-dessus de 心, le cœur. La tête et le cœur passaient ensemble pour le siège de la pensée, d'où le sens de « penser ». Dans l'écriture régulière, 囟 s'est confondu avec 田, qui n'a ici rien à voir avec les champs.","en":"In small seal script, 思 sets 囟, the skull seen from above with its soft spot, over 心, the heart. Head and heart together were held to be the seat of thought, hence the meaning “to think”. In regular script 囟 merged with 田, which has nothing to do with fields here.","roles":{"田":"forme","心":"sens"}}},"撕":{"c":"撕","pinyin":"sī","lectures":["sī"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","其","斤"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3916"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"déchirer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"déchirer, arracher"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他把信撕了。","pinyin":"Tā bǎ xìn sī le.","fr":"Il a mis la lettre en morceaux.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"斯":{"c":"斯","pinyin":"sī","lectures":["sī"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["其","斤"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2950","L7-4871"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ce, ceci (classique)","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Pron","fr":"ce, ceci (langue classique)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"私":{"c":"私","pinyin":"sī","lectures":["sī"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["禾","厶"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0723","L6-0975","L6-1122","L7-0698","L7-3904","L7-3905","L7-3906","L7-3907","L7-3908","L7-3909","L7-3910","L7-3911","L7-4379","L7-5564","L7-5565"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"privé, personnel ; égoïste","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"privé, personnel"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"égoïste ; secret, illégal"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他买了一辆私家车。","pinyin":"Tā mǎi le yī liàng sījiāchē.","fr":"Il s'est acheté une voiture à lui.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"死":{"c":"死","pinyin":"sǐ","lectures":["sǐ"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["歹","匕"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0688","L6-0768","L7-3653","L7-3917","L7-3918"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"mourir ; mort ; à mourir","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"mourir"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"mort ; rigide, figé"},{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"à mort, extrêmement : après un adjectif"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我的花死了。","pinyin":"Wǒ de huā sǐ le.","fr":"Mes fleurs sont mortes.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"今天热死了。","pinyin":"Jīntiān rè sǐ le.","fr":"Il fait une chaleur à crever aujourd'hui.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"似":{"c":"似","pinyin":"sì","lectures":["sì","shì"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","⿰𠄌丶","人"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L3-0436","L3-0790","L4-0647","L4-0682","L6-0369","L7-2359","L7-2452","L7-3923","L7-3924"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"sembler, ressembler","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"sembler, ressembler à"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"四":{"c":"四","pinyin":"sì","lectures":["sì"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L1-0351","L5-0725","L6-0769","L7-3919","L7-3920","L7-3921","L7-5268"],"chemin":{"hsk":82,"lire":81},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"quatre","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我四点下班。","pinyin":"Wǒ sì diǎn xiàbān.","fr":"Je finis le travail à quatre heures.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires et les premiers bronzes, quatre s'écrit avec quatre traits horizontaux superposés, comme un, deux et trois. La forme 四, empruntée pour sa prononciation, la remplace plus tard, à l'époque des Zhou ; ce qu'elle dessinait d'abord reste discuté. Le Shuowen jiezi y voit une figure partagée en quatre.","en":"On oracle bones and early bronzes, four is written as four stacked horizontal strokes, just like one, two and three. The shape 四 took over later, during the Zhou, borrowed for its sound; what it first depicted is still debated. The Shuowen jiezi reads it as a figure divided into four.","roles":{}}},"寺":{"c":"寺","pinyin":"sì","lectures":["sì"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["土","寸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0770","L7-3345","L7-3594","L7-3922"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"temple (bouddhiste)","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"temple bouddhiste, monastère"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我们去山上的寺里看看。","pinyin":"Wǒmen qù shān shang de sì li kànkan.","fr":"Allons jeter un œil au monastère sur la montagne.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"祀":{"c":"祀","pinyin":"sì","lectures":["sì"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["礻","巳"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1927"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"sacrifice, culte","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"offrir des sacrifices, rendre un culte"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"古代皇帝每年都要祭祀天地。","pinyin":"Gǔdài huángdì měi nián dōu yào jìsì tiāndì.","fr":"Dans l'Antiquité, l'empereur offrait chaque année des sacrifices au Ciel et à la Terre.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"肆":{"c":"肆","pinyin":"sì","lectures":["sì"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["镸","聿"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0712","L7-1087"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"effréné ; quatre, en chiffre financier","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"effréné, sans retenue"},{"categorie":"Num","fr":"quatre, graphie financière"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"饲":{"c":"饲","pinyin":"sì","lectures":["sì"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["饣","司"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3926","L7-3927"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"nourrir, élever (animaux)","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"nourrir, élever (des animaux)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"松":{"c":"松","pinyin":"sōng","lectures":["sōng"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","八","厶"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0235","L4-0585","L4-0683","L4-0684","L7-2469","L7-3928","L7-3929"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"lâche, détendu ; relâcher ; pin","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"lâche, desserré ; détendu"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"relâcher, desserrer"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"pin"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"鞋带松了。","pinyin":"Xiédài sōng le.","fr":"Ton lacet est défait.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"耸":{"c":"耸","pinyin":"sǒng","lectures":["sǒng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["人","人","耳"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3930"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"se dresser ; hausser","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"se dresser ; hausser (les épaules)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"宋":{"c":"宋","pinyin":"sòng","lectures":["sòng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["宀","木"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":[],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"Song (dynastie) ; nom de famille","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"Song (dynastie)"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"nom de famille"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"讼":{"c":"讼","pinyin":"sòng","lectures":["sòng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["讠","八","厶"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3945"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"procès, litige","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"procès, litige"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"诵":{"c":"诵","pinyin":"sòng","lectures":["sòng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["讠","龴","用"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0138","L7-2522"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"réciter, lire à voix haute","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"réciter, lire à voix haute"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"送":{"c":"送","pinyin":"sòng","lectures":["sòng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["辶","丷","天"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0352","L2-0507","L2-0508","L3-0177","L5-0969","L6-0771","L6-0772","L7-2097","L7-3080","L7-3817","L7-3931","L7-5173"],"chemin":{"hsk":106},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"offrir ; livrer ; raccompagner","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"offrir, donner en cadeau"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"livrer, envoyer"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"raccompagner, accompagner"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他送了我一本书。","pinyin":"Tā sòng le wǒ yī běn shū.","fr":"Il m'a fait cadeau d'un livre.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"我送你回家吧。","pinyin":"Wǒ sòng nǐ huí jiā ba.","fr":"Je te raccompagne chez toi.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 送 par « envoyer » et l'écrit avec 辵, la marche, que l'on écrit 辶. Au-dessus de 辶, la droite s'écrit aujourd'hui 丷 sur 天, qui ne disent ni le sens ni le son. Accompagner quelqu'un en chemin, faire partir une chose : raccompagner, livrer, offrir.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 送 as “to send” and writes it with 辵, walking, now written 辶. Above 辶, the right part is now written 丷 over 天, which give neither meaning nor sound. Walking someone on their way, sending a thing off: to see off, to deliver, to give.","roles":{"辶":"sens","丷":"forme","天":"forme"}}},"颂":{"c":"颂","pinyin":"sòng","lectures":["sòng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["八","厶","页"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1310"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"louer, célébrer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"louer, célébrer"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"搜":{"c":"搜","pinyin":"sōu","lectures":["sōu"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","臼","丨","又"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L5-0726","L5-0727","L7-3932","L7-3933","L7-3934","L7-3935"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"chercher, fouiller","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"chercher, fouiller ; rechercher (en ligne)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你在网上搜一下就知道了。","pinyin":"Nǐ zài wǎngshang sōu yīxià jiù zhīdào le.","fr":"Fais une recherche en ligne et tu sauras.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"艘":{"c":"艘","pinyin":"sōu","lectures":["sōu"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["舟","臼","丨","又"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L7-3936"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"classificateur des bateaux","acceptions":[{"categorie":"M","fr":"classificateur des bateaux"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"港口停着几艘大船。","pinyin":"Gǎngkǒu tíng zhe jǐ sōu dà chuán.","fr":"Quelques grands navires sont à quai dans le port.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"嗽":{"c":"嗽","pinyin":"sòu","lectures":["sòu"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","束","欠"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2379"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"tousser","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"tousser"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他感冒了，一直咳嗽。","pinyin":"Tā gǎnmào le, yīzhí késou.","fr":"Il est enrhumé et n'arrête pas de tousser.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"苏":{"c":"苏","pinyin":"sū","lectures":["sū"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["卄","办"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0289","L7-3937"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"revenir à soi ; Jiangsu, Suzhou","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"revenir à soi, revivre"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"abréviation de Jiangsu, de Suzhou"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"酥":{"c":"酥","pinyin":"sū","lectures":["sū"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["酉","禾"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3938"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"croustillant, friable ; engourdi","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"croustillant, friable"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"engourdi, sans force"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这种饼干又香又酥。","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng bǐnggān yòu xiāng yòu sū.","fr":"Ces biscuits sont parfumés et fondants.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"俗":{"c":"俗","pinyin":"sú","lectures":["sú"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","谷"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0247","L7-2888","L7-3939","L7-3940","L7-3941","L7-3942","L7-4122","L7-4425","L7-5030","L7-5158"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"vulgaire, banal ; coutume","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"vulgaire, banal, de mauvais goût"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"coutume, usage"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这件衣服的颜色太俗了。","pinyin":"Zhè jiàn yīfu de yánsè tài sú le.","fr":"La couleur de ce vêtement est trop criarde.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"塑":{"c":"塑","pinyin":"sù","lectures":["sù"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["屰","月","土"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0685","L4-0686","L7-0872","L7-3952"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"modeler, sculpter","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"modeler, sculpter"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"宿":{"c":"宿","pinyin":"sù","lectures":["sù","xiǔ","xiù"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["宀","亻","百"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0728","L7-1149","L7-1498","L7-3716","L7-5468"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"loger, passer la nuit","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"loger, passer la nuit"},{"categorie":"M","fr":"nuit (classificateur)","pinyin":"xiǔ"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"学校给我们安排了住宿。","pinyin":"Xuéxiào gěi wǒmen ānpái le zhùsù.","fr":"L'école nous a trouvé un hébergement.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"溯":{"c":"溯","pinyin":"sù","lectures":["sù"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["氵","屰","月"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-5518"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"remonter (le courant)","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"remonter (le courant, aux origines)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"素":{"c":"素","pinyin":"sù","lectures":["sù"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["龶","糸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0773","L6-0858","L6-0943","L6-0969","L6-1003","L7-1872","L7-2368","L7-3174","L7-3946","L7-3947","L7-3948","L7-3949","L7-3950","L7-3951"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"simple, sobre ; végétarien ; élément","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"simple, sobre, uni"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"plat végétarien, maigre"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"élément, facteur"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我今天想吃素。","pinyin":"Wǒ jīntiān xiǎng chī sù.","fr":"Aujourd'hui, j'ai envie de manger sans viande.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"肃":{"c":"肃","pinyin":"sù","lectures":["sù"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L5-0873"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"sérieux, solennel","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"sérieux, solennel, grave"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他的表情很严肃。","pinyin":"Tā de biǎoqíng hěn yánsù.","fr":"Il a l'air très grave.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"诉":{"c":"诉","pinyin":"sù","lectures":["sù"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["讠","斥"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0117","L4-0728","L6-0639","L7-3332","L7-3574","L7-3943","L7-3944","L7-3945"],"chemin":{"hsk":207},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"dire, raconter ; se plaindre","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"dire, raconter ; porter plainte"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 訴 par « dire, se plaindre » : la parole, 言, et, à droite, une partie qui donnait le son. Cette partie s'écrit aujourd'hui 斥, qui se lit chì et ne donne plus le son de sù. Simplifié, 言 devient 讠 : 告诉, c'est dire à quelqu'un.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 訴 as “to tell, to complain”: speech, 言, and, on the right, a part that gave the sound. That part is now written 斥, which is read chì and no longer gives the sound of sù. Simplified, 言 becomes 讠: 告诉 means to tell someone.","roles":{"讠":"sens","斥":"forme"}}},"速":{"c":"速","pinyin":"sù","lectures":["sù"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["辶","束"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0224","L3-0225","L3-0425","L3-0689","L4-0836","L5-0367","L7-0409","L7-0419","L7-1091","L7-1834","L7-1993","L7-3706","L7-4055"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"rapide ; vitesse","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"rapide"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"vitesse"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"酸":{"c":"酸","pinyin":"suān","lectures":["suān"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["酉","厶","八","夂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0687","L4-0688","L5-0729","L7-4610","L7-4618"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"acide, aigre ; courbaturé","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"acide, aigre"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"courbaturé, endolori"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这个苹果很酸。","pinyin":"Zhège píngguǒ hěn suān.","fr":"Cette pomme n'est pas assez mûre, elle pique.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"算":{"c":"算","pinyin":"suàn","lectures":["suàn"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⺮","目","卄"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0087","L2-0254","L2-0509","L3-0321","L5-1064","L6-0478","L6-0774","L6-0775","L7-0256","L7-0357","L7-1401","L7-1715","L7-2198","L7-3057","L7-3954","L7-3955","L7-3956","L7-4195","L7-5118"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"calculer ; compter comme","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"calculer, compter"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"considérer comme, compter pour"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你算一下多少钱。","pinyin":"Nǐ suàn yīxià duōshao qián.","fr":"Calcule combien ça fait.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 算 par « compter » et l'écrit avec 竹, le bambou, et 具, les instruments. On calculait avec des baguettes de bambou. On lit ⺮ en haut, puis 目 et 卄, qui écrivent 具.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 算 as “to count” and writes it with 竹, bamboo, and 具, implements. People calculated with bamboo counting rods. You read ⺮ on top, then 目 and 卄, which write 具.","roles":{"⺮":"sens","目":"sens","卄":"sens"}}},"蒜":{"c":"蒜","pinyin":"suàn","lectures":["suàn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["卄","示","示"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3953"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ail","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"ail"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"做这个菜要放点儿蒜。","pinyin":"Zuò zhège cài yào fàng diǎnr suàn.","fr":"Pour ce plat, il faut ajouter une gousse.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"虽":{"c":"虽","pinyin":"suī","lectures":["suī"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","虫"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0510","L6-0776","L7-3957"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"bien que, quoique","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Conj","fr":"bien que, quoique"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"房子虽小，但很舒服。","pinyin":"Fángzi suī xiǎo, dàn hěn shūfu.","fr":"La maison est petite, mais très confortable.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi écrit 雖, une sorte de gros lézard : 虫, la bête, et 唯 pour le son. Le sens « bien que » vient d'un emprunt. La forme simplifiée garde 口 sur 虫, sans rapport avec le sens.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi writes 雖, a kind of large lizard: 虫, the creature, and 唯 for the sound. The meaning “although” comes from a borrowing. The simplified form keeps 口 over 虫, unrelated to the meaning.","roles":{"口":"forme","虫":"forme"}}},"随":{"c":"随","pinyin":"suí","lectures":["suí"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["阝","辶","𠂇","月"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0511","L2-0512","L3-0690","L4-0689","L5-0276","L5-0730","L5-0731","L5-0732","L7-0081","L7-3958","L7-3959","L7-3960","L7-3961","L7-3962","L7-3963","L7-3964","L7-5519"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"suivre ; au gré de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"suivre, accompagner"},{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"au gré de, comme on veut"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你随我来。","pinyin":"Nǐ suí wǒ lái.","fr":"Suis-moi.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi écrit 隨 et le glose « suivre » : 辵, la marche, et une partie abrégée pour le son. 辶, la marche, dit toujours le sens. La forme simplifiée garde 阝 et écrit dans 辶 𠂇 sur 月, qui ne donnent plus le son de suí.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi writes 隨 and glosses it as “to follow”: 辵, walking, and a shortened part for the sound. 辶, walking, still carries the meaning. The simplified form keeps 阝 and writes 𠂇 over 月 inside 辶, which no longer give the sound of suí.","roles":{"阝":"forme","辶":"sens","𠂇":"forme","月":"forme"}}},"髓":{"c":"髓","pinyin":"suǐ","lectures":["suǐ"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["冎","月","辶","月","𠂇","工"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2207"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"moelle ; essence","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"moelle (des os)"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"essence, quintessence"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他得了病，需要骨髓移植。","pinyin":"Tā dé le bìng, xūyào gǔsuǐ yízhí.","fr":"Il est malade et a besoin d'une greffe de moelle osseuse.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"岁":{"c":"岁","pinyin":"suì","lectures":["suì"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["山","夕"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0353","L5-0733","L6-0777"],"chemin":{"hsk":106,"lire":102},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ans (âge), année","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你几岁了？","pinyin":"Nǐ jǐ suì le?","fr":"Tu as quel âge ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"岁 est la forme simplifiée de 歲, dont l'origine ne se lit plus dans la graphie actuelle. On y voit 山, la montagne, posé sur 夕, le soir. Pour s'en souvenir : les soirs passent sur la montagne, qui reste, et les années s'additionnent.","en":"岁 is the simplified form of 歲, whose origin can no longer be read in the current shape. What one sees is 山, a mountain, set on 夕, evening. As a memory aid: evenings pass over the mountain, which stays put, and the years add up.","roles":{"山":"forme","夕":"forme"}}},"碎":{"c":"碎","pinyin":"suì","lectures":["suì"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["石","亠","人","人","十"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0734","L7-1134","L7-3167"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"cassé, en morceaux ; menu","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"cassé, en morceaux, brisé"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"se briser, casser"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"menu, fragmentaire ; bavard"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"杯子掉在地上，碎了。","pinyin":"Bēizi diào zài dìshang, suì le.","fr":"Le verre est tombé par terre et s'est brisé.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"遂":{"c":"遂","pinyin":"suì","lectures":["suì","suí"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["辶","丷","豕"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3965"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"réaliser (un vœu) ; alors","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"satisfaire, réaliser (un vœu)"},{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"alors, aussitôt (écrit)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"隧":{"c":"隧","pinyin":"suì","lectures":["suì"],