":"这件衣服洗了以后缩了。","pinyin":"Zhè jiàn yīfu xǐ le yǐhòu suō le.","fr":"Ce vêtement a rétréci au lavage.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"所":{"c":"所","pinyin":"suǒ","lectures":["suǒ"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["户","斤"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L2-0513","L2-0514","L3-0081","L3-0691","L3-0692","L4-0769","L5-0737","L5-0875","L6-0088","L6-0778","L7-1347","L7-2574","L7-2580","L7-3258","L7-3736","L7-3964","L7-3974","L7-3975","L7-3976","L7-4380","L7-4381","L7-4943","L7-4944","L7-5076","L7-5077","L7-5303","L7-5341","L7-5428","L7-5582"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"lieu ; classif. des bâtiments ; ce que","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"lieu, endroit ; institut"},{"categorie":"M","fr":"classificateur des bâtiments : école, maison"},{"categorie":"Aux","fr":"particule : ce que, langue écrite"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这是一所很好的学校。","pinyin":"Zhè shì yī suǒ hěn hǎo de xuéxiào.","fr":"C'est une très bonne école.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 所 par « le bruit du bois qu'on abat » : 斤, la hache, et 戶 pour le son. Le sens « lieu » vient d'un emprunt, comme « ce que » dans la langue écrite. 户 se lit hù : il ne donne plus le son de suǒ.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 所 as “the sound of felling trees”: 斤, the axe, and 戶 for the sound. The meaning “place” comes from a borrowing, as does “that which” in written Chinese. 户 is read hù: it no longer gives the sound of suǒ.","roles":{"户":"forme","斤":"sens"}}},"索":{"c":"索","pinyin":"suǒ","lectures":["suǒ"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["十","冖","糸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0727","L5-0821","L6-0785","L7-0276","L7-0771","L7-2596","L7-2907","L7-3915","L7-3977","L7-3978","L7-3979"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"corde ; chercher ; réclamer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"corde, câble"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"chercher, rechercher"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"demander, réclamer"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"警察找到了新的线索。","pinyin":"Jǐngchá zhǎodào le xīn de xiànsuǒ.","fr":"La police a trouvé une nouvelle piste.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"锁":{"c":"锁","pinyin":"suǒ","lectures":["suǒ"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["钅","⺌","贝"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0738","L7-1170","L7-2495","L7-2601","L7-2602","L7-3980"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"serrure, cadenas ; fermer à clé","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"serrure, cadenas"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"fermer à clé"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"出门别忘了锁门。","pinyin":"Chūmén bié wàng le suǒ mén.","fr":"En sortant, n'oublie pas de verrouiller la porte.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"他":{"c":"他","pinyin":"tā","lectures":["tā"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","也"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0354","L1-0355","L2-0426","L7-1877","L7-3981"],"chemin":{"hsk":111,"lire":103},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"il, lui","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他是我朋友。","pinyin":"Tā shì wǒ péngyou.","fr":"C'est mon ami.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"他 est une forme plus récente de 佗, que le Shuowen jiezi décrit comme un composé : 人, l'homme, pour le sens, et 它 pour le son. Dans l'écriture, 也 a pris la place de 它, et il ne donne pas le son. Le mot a d'abord signifié « autre », puis « il », la personne dont on parle.","en":"他 is a later form of 佗, which the Shuowen jiezi describes as a compound: 人, a person, gives the meaning and 它 gives the sound. In writing, 也 took the place of 它, and it does not give the sound. The word first meant “other”, then “he”, the person being talked about.","roles":{"亻":"sens","也":"forme"}}},"塌":{"c":"塌","pinyin":"tā","lectures":["tā"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["土","日","习","习"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0778","L7-3918","L7-3982","L7-4939"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"s'effondrer, s'écrouler","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"s'effondrer, s'écrouler"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"大雨把墙冲塌了。","pinyin":"Dà yǔ bǎ qiáng chōng tā le.","fr":"La pluie a fait tomber le mur.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null}}}
